  "summary": "Manual spec verification passed. Page browsing now uses a lazy dedicated execution IPC lane via IPCBridge.spawn_lane() so slow page fetches no longer monopolize the shared control bridge. Targeted and broader regressions passed (241 total in the broader batch), live probing against the dev daemon confirmed control-lane get_status() stayed immediate while a stale-node page fetch continued on the execution lane, and the remaining unawaited-coroutine test warning was eliminated by passing async callables into run_worker instead of eagerly creating coroutine objects.",
